    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Courier 79 is a stylized roguelike experience about delivering orders... and maybe something more... who knows?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/e173285a4b338358cbc08edbe94b06aa.poster.avif?t=1734434765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/e173285a4b338358cbc08edbe94b06aa.webm?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/e173285a4b338358cbc08edbe94b06aa.mp4?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the streets in full detail on Italy's small island called Pinalo. Each day is different, new orders, new challenges. Adaptation is key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Experience the full first 7 days in the free demo!</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/83ff2f44ce41f800b8ac6bf47d51aa77.webp?t=1734434765\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast variety of cargo and orders to deliver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders come in random.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle upgrades that best fit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Benefits that shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied amount of vehicles to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver regular packages or drugs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather that affects gameplay in different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling!!!!!!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/580aa9e65a937bee62a82367b866e3ee.webp?t=1734434765\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cargo, to car customization, to benefits, Courier 79 is built to be as much replayable as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/22a7ebb796141d9bebe1d7fb6b9b8ac1.poster.avif?t=1734434765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/22a7ebb796141d9bebe1d7fb6b9b8ac1.webm?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/22a7ebb796141d9bebe1d7fb6b9b8ac1.mp4?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/e39ec7de6dfcc1597a27fddfce7a63a4.webp?t=1734434765\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every out of 3 vehicles is carefully fine-tuned to deliver the best experience for all kinds of drivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/b29edfe34032fb6ce0ca2b96094a51a9.poster.avif?t=1734434765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/b29edfe34032fb6ce0ca2b96094a51a9.webm?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/b29edfe34032fb6ce0ca2b96094a51a9.mp4?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Courier 79 is a stylized roguelike experience about delivering orders... and maybe something more... who knows?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/e173285a4b338358cbc08edbe94b06aa.poster.avif?t=1734434765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/e173285a4b338358cbc08edbe94b06aa.webm?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/e173285a4b338358cbc08edbe94b06aa.mp4?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the streets in full detail on Italy's small island called Pinalo. Each day is different, new orders, new challenges. Adaptation is key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Experience the full first 7 days in the free demo!</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/83ff2f44ce41f800b8ac6bf47d51aa77.webp?t=1734434765\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast variety of cargo and orders to deliver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders come in random.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle upgrades that best fit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Benefits that shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied amount of vehicles to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver regular packages or drugs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather that affects gameplay in different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling!!!!!!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/580aa9e65a937bee62a82367b866e3ee.webp?t=1734434765\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cargo, to car customization, to benefits, Courier 79 is built to be as much replayable as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/22a7ebb796141d9bebe1d7fb6b9b8ac1.poster.avif?t=1734434765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/22a7ebb796141d9bebe1d7fb6b9b8ac1.webm?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/22a7ebb796141d9bebe1d7fb6b9b8ac1.mp4?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/e39ec7de6dfcc1597a27fddfce7a63a4.webp?t=1734434765\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every out of 3 vehicles is carefully fine-tuned to deliver the best experience for all kinds of drivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/b29edfe34032fb6ce0ca2b96094a51a9.poster.avif?t=1734434765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/b29edfe34032fb6ce0ca2b96094a51a9.webm?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558350/extras/b29edfe34032fb6ce0ca2b96094a51a9.mp4?t=1734434765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
